OL,3,ANearly 3 million Teslas recalled in
OL,4,AChina over hidden door handles
OL,5,
OL,6,FMade popular by multi-billionaire Elon
OL,7,FMusk's Tesla, hidden door handles are
OL,8,Fdesigned to tuck seamlessly within the
OL,9,Fcar's door panel and only extend
OL,10,Foutwards when the owner approaches
OL,11,Ftheir vehicle.
